# Normalise line endings to LF in the repository, always.
#
# 2026-09-15: commit 8d0851f (contract-automation, since reverted as a mistake)
# rewrote all 163 tracked files from LF to CRLF. That turned every markdown
# frontmatter delimiter into `---\r\n`, which the content parsers don't match,
# and the glossary schema tests went red on main. Without this file nothing
# stops a Windows checkout doing it again.
#
# `text=auto eol=lf` means: git decides what's text, and text is stored AND
# checked out as LF on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries must never be touched.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.webp binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip  binary
*.mp4  binary
